==Battleground==
*2 [[Rain D.|Rain Ds]] spawn after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.
*1 [[H. Nah]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Rain D.]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Johnnyleon]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Angelic Sleipnir]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use [[:Category:Long Distance Cats|Long Distance units]] and [[:Category:Wave Attack Cats|wave attackers]] to snipe the backliners, and watch your wallet. [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Macho Legs]] and [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling Cat]] together with are units that have great synergy to have waves continuously.

Use [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]] to kill the Trolly Bloggers that would push the unit, it could attack multiple times.
[[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] deals a lot of damage to enemies and can easily take them out in conjunction with Meatshield.

==Trivia==
*Rainbow Bridge Toll not only hints at [[Johnnyleon]]'s multiple colors, but could potentially also reference many different things, including:
**[[wikia:drstone:Chrome|Chrome]]'s "Rainbow Bridge" technique in ''[[wikipedia:Dr. Stone|Dr. Stone]]'', where he throws various minerals into a fire to produce flames of three different colors: amber, [[:Category:Alien Enemies|blue]], and [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|purple]], in that order.
**The metaphorical [[wikipedia:Rainbow Bridge (pets)|Rainbow Bridge]] where dead pets end up to later be reunited with their owners.
**Various real locations such as the [[wikipedia:Rainbow Bridge (Niagara Falls)|Rainbow Bridge]] on the United States-Canada border, or the [[wikipedia:Rainbow Bridge (Tokyo)|Rainbow Bridge]] in Tokyo, Japan.
**[[wikipedia:Bifröst|Bifröst]], a burning rainbow bridge in Norse mythology that connects the realm of mortals, Midgard (Earth), with the realm of the gods, Asgard.

